and someday I'll become president.

251
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:04,160
I'm THE Senator Phillips, damn it!

252
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:07,160
Listen to me, you punk band reject!

253
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:11,257
I'm gonna make sure you rot in prison
for the rest of your miser - Hear this,

254
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:12,660
as I won't repeat it.

255
00:16:15,500 --> 00:16:16,840
Drive the car.

256
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:21,660
This psychopath's gonna kill me!

257
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:24,297
I have to get the hell out of this car!

258
00:16:24,380 --> 00:16:25,940
If I don't, I'm a goner!

259
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:28,380
Someone help me!

260
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:33,160
What the hell?!

261
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:38,320
What was that?

262
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:40,517
I'm positive I jumped out of the car.

263
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:43,017
So what the hell am I
doing back in the car?

264
00:16:43,100 --> 00:16:44,420
I don't get it.

265
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:46,140
What's going on?

266
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:48,675
Your job is to catch up to that truck.

267
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:50,960
Fail to do so and you die.

268
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:52,900
Yes, sir.

269
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:55,380
How am I still in the car?

270
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:57,420
Of course, that's it.

271
00:16:57,580 --> 00:16:58,460
I'm a senator.

272
00:16:58,980 --> 00:16:59,940
What can't I do?

273
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,140
Yes, it makes total sense now.

274
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:14,500
I still sense Dio's sinister bloodlust.

275
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:16,257
Its presence is overwhelming.

276
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:17,880
He's coming for us.

277
00:17:18,060 --> 00:17:20,337
You can bet your ass he's on our trail.

278
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:23,891
Are you saying that Dio somehow
knows our precise location?

279
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:25,090
Not quite.

280
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:28,536
He stole the body of my
grandfather, Jonathan Joestar.

281
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:32,962
I can sense his body, but I can't
tell if he's nearby or far away.

282
00:17:33,140 --> 00:17:36,846
I have a general feeling, but I
don't know exactly where he is.

283
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,777
It's like when we got to Cairo,

284
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:42,077
and while I knew he was here,
I couldn't pinpoint his lair.

285
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:44,631
Lucky for us, the same thing goes for Dio.

286
00:17:45,520 --> 00:17:47,077
All he knows is that we're nearby,

287
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:50,101
but he's unable to tell
the difference between us.

288
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:54,300
And he probably doesn't know we've
separated, which is good for now.

289
00:17:56,500 --> 00:17:58,382
Why the hell isn't this working?

290
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:02,306
Cars always start up when they
do this kind of thing in movies.

291
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:08,981
Seems like there's a traffic jam.

292
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:10,700
I'm sorry, sir.

293
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:13,177
The evening commute is
always bumper to bumper.

294
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:14,090
Move it.

295
00:18:14,540 --> 00:18:15,775
But we're stuck here.

296
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,677
There's just too much traffic.

297
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:22,357
Have you forgotten there's a
sidewalk use it the sidewalk But

298
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:26,860
it's covered with people heading
home from work and your point go

299
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:28,380
Yes, sir

300
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:31,430
Faster

301
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:44,180
Okay, it's running hurry
up and get on Polnareff.

302
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,150
Oh, yeah

303
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:51,780
Oh, the things I do for you!

304
00:18:52,100 --> 00:18:54,977
But I've done everything you've
asked, so you'll spare my life, right?

305
00:18:55,060 --> 00:18:57,589
There's no need to kill
a helpless senator!

306
00:18:58,120 --> 00:18:58,950
Wrong.

307
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:03,214
I have to be dreaming?

308
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,977
What other explanation is there?

309
00:19:05,060 --> 00:19:07,117
As if a senator like me could be killed!

310
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,030
Woo-hoo-hoo!

311
00:19:08,113 --> 00:19:09,260
It's just a dream!

312
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:11,630
Found you.

313
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:12,860
Now get closer.

314
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:14,197
We need to catch up to them.

315
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:17,340
I can't use the world
if I'm this far away.

316
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:19,420
Look, here he comes.

317
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:20,800
You see that car?

318
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:22,260
That's Dio's ride.

319
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:25,490
Kakyoin!

320
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:30,300
It's Kakyoin's.

321
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:31,720
Take this, Dio!

322
00:19:32,020 --> 00:19:33,200
Emerald Splash!

323
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:52,570
Unbelievable.

324
00:19:52,653 --> 00:19:54,877
He deflected my attack
with the flick of a finger.

325
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,240
He barely moved.

326
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:58,171
But how do you like this?

327
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:06,860
He even dodged the
concentrated splash? Damn it!

328
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:10,997
When did he bring out his stand?

329
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:12,786
How could I have missed that?

330
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:18,660
Well, that's a shame.

331
00:20:18,860 --> 00:20:20,154
He's too far away now.

332
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:24,051
My punch seems to have thrown
him out of the world's range.

333
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:28,460
What's happening?

334
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:33,100
And what precisely would I gain by
explaining this situation to you?

335
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:35,438
Pay attention to the road and drive.

336
00:20:40,060 --> 00:20:41,700
Be careful, Kakyoin.

337
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,940
You were way too close to it.

338
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,680
Please, forgive me.

339
00:20:46,040 --> 00:20:47,480
I didn't mean...

340
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:51,857
It was only a few months
ago when Dio asked

341
00:20:51,940 --> 00:20:54,646
me if I was really going
to vomit out of fear.

342
00:20:54,900 --> 00:20:58,194
That monster had the audacity
to tell me I should relax.

343
00:20:59,100 --> 00:21:00,760
Bastard! Never again!

344
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:02,746
I'll never lose to you again!

345
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:04,740
Are you alright, Kakyoin?

346
00:21:04,900 --> 00:21:07,076
Did you catch a glimpse of the world?

347
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:08,010
Yes.

348
00:21:08,093 --> 00:21:11,080
I saw it when I attacked
Dio from ten meters away.

349
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:14,197
If I had gotten any closer,
I would have been done for.

350
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:16,057
But we know one thing for certain.

351
00:21:16,140 --> 00:21:20,316
His stand holds a power more horrific
than we could have ever imagined.

352
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:23,500
However, we know two
things about it. First,

353
00:21:23,740 --> 00:21:27,417
his stand doesn't have the reach of my
Hierophant Green or your Hermit Purple.

354
00:21:27,500 --> 00:21:30,580
It's a close-range power
stand, like Star Platinum.

355
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:32,720
It has a range of about 10 meters.

356
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:33,870
Second,

357
00:21:33,953 --> 00:21:38,229
it attacked with its fist, so it doesn't
use projectile weapons like bullets.

358
00:21:38,420 --> 00:21:39,500
That being said,

359
00:21:39,740 --> 00:21:41,977
if we can sneak up on
him and get within range,

360
00:21:42,060 --> 00:21:46,417
We just might have a chance of finishing
him off We have to figure out his

361
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:51,560
secret even so we have to exercise extreme
caution when approaching this bastard

362
00:21:52,980 --> 00:21:56,000
Hold on why does car suddenly stop?

363
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:02,600
Incoming we're about to be hit

364
00:22:07,860 --> 00:22:08,690
Mr.

365
00:22:08,773 --> 00:22:09,603
Joestar

366
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:38,620
What are you doing, Kakyoin?

367
00:22:38,860 --> 00:22:40,280
I understand now.

368
00:22:42,280 --> 00:22:45,600
I know now how to uncover
the secret of Dio's stand.

369
00:23:27,300 --> 00:23:29,535
Whenever I think about Avdol and Iggy,

370
00:23:29,620 --> 00:23:32,817
it makes the hairs on the
back of my neck stand on end.

371
00:23:32,900 --> 00:23:36,457
I'm sure it's because they were the
first to treat me like a friend.

372
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:39,422
My friends and I were on
a journey to defeat Dio.

373
00:23:39,660 --> 00:23:41,680
All right, here it comes!

374
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:42,923
Thank you.
